    "detailed_description": "\ud83c\udf35 Yeehaw, Pardner! \ud83c\udf35<br><br><strong>Guntris </strong>is a rooting, tooting, fast shooting good time.<br><br>Step into the dusty boots of a sharpshooting desperado and dive into the most thrilling Tetris style experience yet. Guntris combines the timeless challenge of Tetris with the heart-pounding action of the Wild West.<br><br>\ud83d\udd2b Shoot 'Em Up! \ud83d\udd2b<br><br>In Guntris, you don't just place blocks \u2013 you blast 'em! Use your trusty six-shooter to clear lines and take down outlaws. Aim true, shoot fast, and watch the pieces fall into place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125590/extras/cf8f22bd461a9269264b28b4a60d6bba.poster.avif?t=1725606567\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125590/extras/cf8f22bd461a9269264b28b4a60d6bba.webm?t=1725606567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125590/extras/cf8f22bd461a9269264b28b4a60d6bba.mp4?t=1725606567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfae Features:<br><br>    Low Poly Charm: Immerse yourself in a beautifully crafted, low poly Western world.<br>    High Stakes: Face off against dynamite chucking bandits as you stack your way to victory.<br>    Fast-Paced Action: Quick draw your way with precision and skill.<br>    Epic Showdowns: Down your trusty bottle of Whiskey to slow down time.]<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Why Guntris?<br><br>    Unique Gameplay: Experience a fresh twist on the classic Tetris formula.<br>    Stunning Visuals: Enjoy a vibrant, stylized Western setting.<br>    Endless Fun: Challenge yourself and friends to beat high scores and become the ultimate Guntris legend.<br><br>Lock and Load, Cowboy! \ud83d\udc0e<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125590/extras/28e2dd7d286ca78fada4cc324e07e269.poster.avif?t=1725606567\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125590/extras/28e2dd7d286ca78fada4cc324e07e269.webm?t=1725606567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125590/extras/28e2dd7d286ca78fada4cc324e07e269.mp4?t=1725606567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Are you ready to take on the frontier? Saddle up and download Guntris today for an adventure like no other. The West is waiting \u2013 and it's time to show 'em who\u2019s boss!",
